# Security (X-inspired)

- Password login.
- New or untrusted device: 6-digit code (TTL, attempt lock). Code goes to the temporary mailbox, not SMS.
- TOTP MFA (authenticator app). No SMS. No phone number identity.
- Trusted device list. Session list with revoke.
- One active session per account: a new successful login revokes others.
- Suspicious login: notify via the account/temp mail path.
- Passkeys/WebAuthn are out of v1.
- Read [docs/security.md](docs/security.md) before changing login order.
